WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.834 --> 00:00:06.834
-The early 1980s saw the rise of
an exciting new rock genre

00:00:06.834 --> 00:00:10.367
called new wave, and one duo was
at the forefront.

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:14.267
Roland Orzabal and Curt Smith
and their band, Tears for Fears.

00:00:14.267 --> 00:00:17.434
In 1985, Tears for Fears
released their album

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:19.200
"Songs from the Big Chair,"

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.868
which included the smash hit,
"Head Over Heels."

00:00:21.868 --> 00:00:24.667
With iconic melodies and
thoughtful lyrics, the track

00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:27.667
would live on as one of the
great rock songs of all time.

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:31.501
But America never heard
its first draft until now.

00:00:37.667 --> 00:00:42.834
♪♪

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:48.033
♪♪

00:00:48.033 --> 00:00:51.467
♪ -I wanted to be
with you alone ♪

